cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bansat in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bansat (بنسټ): A blueprint-first framework for building software"
abstract: >-
  Bansat (Pashto for "foundation") is a blueprint-first framework and Agent Skill for AI
  coding agents, for planning new software projects and auditing existing ones before code
  is written. It covers product requirements, architecture, security, privacy law, UI
  states, delivery and launch readiness, with 24 stack profiles and a public privacy-law
  registry of 120 jurisdictions that cites official sources and is watched weekly.
authors:
